{"Title":"An Act relative to electronic toll payments","BillNumber":"H3469","DocketNumber":"HD2920","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"T_V1","Name":"Tommy Vitolo","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/T_V1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T13:17:01.76"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"T_V1","Name":"Tommy Vitolo","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/T_V1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T13:17:01.76"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3469/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Vitolo of Brookline, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3469) of Tommy Vitolo relative to electronic toll payments.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tSection 13 of chapter 6C of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by adding the following subsection:-\r\n\t(d) Information on tolls, including, where applicable, toll usage, tolls due, balance, late and other fees, fines, penalties and other amounts due associated with toll or other transactions and payment options shall be made available through an online database that is searchable by both (i) vehicle registration number and (ii) date of toll assessment. Such information shall be accessible through the online database within 1 business day of a toll being assessed. Information for accessing the online database shall be printed on a sign visible to drivers at the point where a toll is assessed. No invoice issued by the department to a vehicle’s registered owner of record or responsible party for purposes of collecting tolls shall be mailed fewer than 7 days after the assessment of a toll.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}